{
  "_comment": [
    "CLUSTER ARTICLE GRAPH — one per article at /encyclopedia/{hub}/{slug}/.",
    "",
    "WHAT FILLS THE PLACEHOLDERS — all of it comes from the article's own",
    "frontmatter and from data/manifest.json. Nothing here is written by hand.",
    "",
    "  {{URL}}                 frontmatter `url`, made absolute: https://opengrants.io{url}",
    "  {{TITLE}}               frontmatter `title` — must equal the visible H1 exactly, <=110 chars",
    "  {{META_DESCRIPTION}}    frontmatter `metaDescription` — the direct-answer block, trimmed",
    "  {{SCHEMA_TYPE}}         frontmatter `schemaType`: Article or TechArticle",
    "  {{PRIMARY_ENTITY}}      frontmatter `primaryEntity`",
    "  {{HUB_TITLE}} {{HUB_URL}}   from data/taxonomy.json for this article's hub",
    "  {{DATE_PUBLISHED}}      frontmatter `datePublished`, ISO 8601 with timezone",
    "  {{DATE_MODIFIED}}       frontmatter `dateModified` — changes ONLY on substantive change",
    "  {{IMAGE_URL_16X9}} {{IMAGE_URL_4X3}} {{IMAGE_URL_1X1}}   article hero variants;",
    "                          delete the image node entirely if the article has no image",
    "  {{AUTHOR_*}}            frontmatter `author.*`",
    "  {{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_3}}     THIRD sameAs URL — a human must supply this (ORCID, personal",
    "                          site, professional registry, Wikidata). Do not invent one.",
    "  {{REVIEWER_*}}          frontmatter `reviewer.*`. If reviewer.name is still",
    "                          REVIEWER_REQUIRED the article is not publishable and this",
    "                          graph must not be emitted.",
    "  {{TERM_SLUG_N}}         frontmatter `definedTerms[]` — @id refs into the glossary set",
    "  {{CITATION_NAME_N}} {{CITATION_URL_N}}   one CreativeWork per external source, from",
    "                          `externalSources` in data/manifest.json. Emit ALL of them",
    "                          (8-15 per article); the two below are shape examples.",
    "  {{FAQ_QUESTION_N}} {{FAQ_ANSWER_N}}      from the visible FAQ H3s and their answers",
    "",
    "RULES",
    "  1. Every value here must appear in the visible text of the page. Google's",
    "     explicit requirement. Visible Published / Last reviewed dates must match",
    "     datePublished / dateModified character for character.",
    "  2. Organization and the author Person are referenced by @id only. Their full",
    "     definitions live in schema/organization.jsonld and on the author page.",
    "     The reviewer Person is defined inline because there is no reviewer page yet;",
    "     if reviewer pages are added, move it and reference by @id like the author.",
    "  3. FAQPage is emitted because it is free. NO Google rich result exists for it",
    "     (ended 2026-05-07). Never write FAQ content for the markup. See README.md.",
    "  4. `about` -> DefinedTerm is for entity disambiguation, not a ranking play.",
    "  5. Delete any node or property you cannot populate truthfully."
  ],
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "{{SCHEMA_TYPE}}",
      "@id": "{{URL}}#article",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{URL}}#webpage" },
      "mainEntityOfPage": { "@id": "{{URL}}#webpage" },
      "headline": "{{TITLE}}",
      "name": "{{TITLE}}",
      "description": "{{META_DESCRIPTION}}",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "isAccessibleForFree": true,
      "datePublished": "{{DATE_PUBLISHED}}",
      "dateModified": "{{DATE_MODIFIED}}",
      "author": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/authors/sedale-turbovsky/#person" },
      "reviewedBy": { "@id": "{{URL}}#reviewer" },
      "publisher": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization" },
      "image": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": "{{IMAGE_URL_16X9}}",
        "contentUrl": "{{IMAGE_URL_16X9}}"
      },
      "about": [
        { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/encyclopedia/glossary/#term-{{TERM_SLUG_1}}" },
        { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/encyclopedia/glossary/#term-{{TERM_SLUG_2}}" }
      ],
      "citation": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "name": "{{CITATION_NAME_1}}",
          "url": "{{CITATION_URL_1}}"
        },
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "name": "{{CITATION_NAME_2}}",
          "url": "{{CITATION_URL_2}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "{{URL}}#webpage",
      "url": "{{URL}}",
      "name": "{{TITLE}}",
      "description": "{{META_DESCRIPTION}}",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#website" },
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{URL}}#breadcrumb" },
      "primaryImageOfPage": { "@id": "{{URL}}#article" },
      "datePublished": "{{DATE_PUBLISHED}}",
      "dateModified": "{{DATE_MODIFIED}}",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "potentialAction": {
        "@type": "ReadAction",
        "target": ["{{URL}}"]
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{URL}}#breadcrumb",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "https://opengrants.io/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Encyclopedia",
          "item": "https://opengrants.io/encyclopedia/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 3,
          "name": "{{HUB_TITLE}}",
          "item": "https://opengrants.io{{HUB_URL}}"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 4,
          "name": "{{TITLE}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "https://opengrants.io/authors/sedale-turbovsky/#person",
      "name": "{{AUTHOR_NAME}}",
      "url": "https://opengrants.io{{AUTHOR_PROFILE_URL}}",
      "jobTitle": "{{AUTHOR_CREDENTIALS}}",
      "worksFor": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization" },
      "sameAs": [
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_1}}",
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_2}}",
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_3}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "{{URL}}#reviewer",
      "name": "{{REVIEWER_NAME}}",
      "description": "{{REVIEWER_CREDENTIALS}}"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization"
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "{{URL}}#faq",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{URL}}#webpage" },
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "{{FAQ_QUESTION_1}}",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "{{FAQ_ANSWER_1}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "{{FAQ_QUESTION_2}}",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "{{FAQ_ANSWER_2}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
